  "title": "A brief comment on the dynamical behavior of a forced nonlinear slewing beam: 1. Superharmonic resonance",
  "abstract": "This paper describes the dynamical behavior of a nonlinear flexible beam (cubic nonlinearities considered) connected to a dc motor (responsible for the slewing motion) when the angular displacement of the slewing axis and its derivatives are considered to be of a harmonic type and the system is excited near a resonance (present due to the nonlinear contribution). Copyright © 2005 by ABCM.",
